   "sprite": "crate",
   "tint": [
    0.62,
    0.78,
    0.9
   ],
   "observe": "Something square and man-made rests on the pond floor a stride out from the bank, furred with silt. Too far to reach across open water. But water can be made to bear weight, if you know the trick of cold.",
   "on_interact_accomplishment": "found_the_frozen_cache",
   "toast": "Kneeling on the ice, you lever the silt-caked strongbox free. Drake-work, old, its lock long rusted through. Inside, dry against all odds, a few keepsakes someone drowned here meant never to be found.",
